  description: "It\u2019s equal to pi, multiplied by two. But it has half of the legs
    in its symbol? The tau is a lie!\n\nUse 5 letters to get digits in \u03C4 to find
    the order to press the buttons in.\n\nBased on Pie by KingBranBran.\n\nThis is
    my first module! I was going\n\nManual can be found at ktane.timwi.de or in the
    bundled manuals folder.\nSource code is at https://github.com/Infusion478/KTANE-Tau\n\nComes
    with Twitch Plays support."
